ransparent\">0</s>7,2<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,7<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>6,8<br />11,1<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,4<br />13,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,0<br />10,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>3,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,2<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>8,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>2,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">S\u00e9lection en \u00e9quipe nationale **</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2017-</td><td valign=\"top\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Lebanon.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Liban\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Flag_of_Lebanon.svg/20px-Flag_of_Lebanon.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Flag_of_Lebanon.svg/40px-Flag_of_Lebanon.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2880\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_du_Liban_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe du Liban masculine de basket-ball\">Liban</a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>** Points marqu\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9quipe nationale en match officiel.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Norvel Pelle</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"1993-02-03\" data-sort-value=\"1993-02-03\"><a href=\"/wiki/3_f%C3%A9vrier_en_sport\" title=\"3 f\u00e9vrier en sport\">3 f\u00e9vrier</a> <a href=\"/wiki/1993_en_basket-ball\" title=\"1993 en basket-ball\">1993</a></time>, \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Saint_John%27s\" title=\"Saint John&#39;s\">Saint John's</a>, en <a href=\"/wiki/Antigua-et-Barbuda\" title=\"Antigua-et-Barbuda\">Antigua-et-Barbuda</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Antigua-et-Barbuda\" title=\"Antigua-et-Barbuda\">antiguayen</a>, naturalis\u00e9 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89tats-Unis\" title=\"\u00c9tats-Unis\">am\u00e9ricain</a>, ayant la nationalit\u00e9 <a href=\"/wiki/Liban\" title=\"Liban\">libanaise</a>, de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a>. Il \u00e9volue au poste de <a href=\"/wiki/Pivot_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Pivot (basket-ball)\">pivot</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Norvel_Pelle\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Norvel Pelle\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-07-02\" data-sort-value=\"2019-07-02\">2 juillet 2019</time>, il signe un contrat <i>two-way</i> avec les <a href=\"/wiki/76ers_de_Philadelphie\" title=\"76ers de Philadelphie\">76ers de Philadelphie</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-02-07\" data-sort-value=\"2020-02-07\">7 f\u00e9vrier 2020</time>, son contrat est converti en un contrat r\u00e9gulier<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-01-22\" data-sort-value=\"2021-01-22\">22 janvier 2021</time>, il s'engage avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Nets_de_Brooklyn\" title=\"Nets de Brooklyn\">Nets de Brooklyn</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-02-16\" data-sort-value=\"2021-02-16\">16 f\u00e9vrier 2021</time>, il est coup\u00e9<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-02-25\" data-sort-value=\"2021-02-25\">25 f\u00e9vrier 2021</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours en faveur des <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_de_Sacramento\" title=\"Kings de Sacramento\">Kings de Sacramento</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-04-02\" data-sort-value=\"2021-04-02\">2 avril 2021</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-04-22\" data-sort-value=\"2021-04-22\">22 avril 2021</time>, il signe un contrat de plusieurs saisons en faveur des <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Il est licenci\u00e9 en juillet<sup class=\"need&#95;ref&#95;tag\" style=\"padding-left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:R%C3%A9f%C3%A9rence_n%C3%A9cessaire\" title=\"Aide:R\u00e9f\u00e9rence n\u00e9cessaire\"><span title=\"Ce passage n\u00e9cessite une r\u00e9f\u00e9rence ; voir l&#39;aide.\">&#91;r\u00e9f.&#160;n\u00e9cessaire&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-12-24\" data-sort-value=\"2021-12-24\">24 d\u00e9cembre 2021</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Celtics_de_Boston\" title=\"Celtics de Boston\">Celtics de Boston</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> mais il ne jouera pas avec la franchise. D\u00e9but <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2022-01\" data-sort-value=\"2022-01\">janvier 2022</time>, il signe le m\u00eame contrat avec le <a href=\"/wiki/Jazz_de_l%27Utah\" title=\"Jazz de l&#39;Utah\">Jazz de l'Utah</a><sup class=\"need&#95;ref&#95;tag\" style=\"padding-left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:R%C3%A9f%C3%A9rence_n%C3%A9cessaire\" title=\"Aide:R\u00e9f\u00e9rence n\u00e9cessaire\"><span title=\"Ce passage n\u00e9cessite une r\u00e9f\u00e9rence ; voir l&#39;aide.\">&#91;r\u00e9f.&#160;n\u00e9cessaire&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Norvel_Pelle\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Norvel Pelle\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Notes_et_r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"Notes_et_r.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small decimal\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\">Six matchs durant la Supercoupe international de Syrie 2024</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://basket-infos.com/2019/07/02/philly-signe-lun-des-meilleurs-defenseurs-de-g-league/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Philly signe l\u2019un des meilleurs d\u00e9fenseurs de G-League</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">Basket Infos</span> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-08-02\" data-sort-value=\"2020-08-02\">2 ao\u00fbt 2020</time>)</small></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nbcsports.com/philadelphia/76ers/jonah-bolden-waived-sixers-norvel-pelle-signed-nba-contract\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Another roster move for Sixers as 2-way player gets rewarded</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">NBC Sports Philadelphia</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-02-07\" data-sort-value=\"2020-02-07\">7 f\u00e9vrier 2020</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-08-02\" data-sort-value=\"2020-08-02\">2 ao\u00fbt 2020</time>)</small></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031703/https://basket-infos.com/2021/01/22/les-nets-signent-un-interieur/\">https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031703/https://basket-infos.com/2021/01/22/les-nets-signent-un-interieur/</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.insidebasket.com/actu/andre-roberson-debarque-a-brooklyn.html\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Andre Roberson d\u00e9barque \u00e0 Brooklyn</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">Inside Basket</span> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2023-11-21\" data-sort-value=\"2023-11-21\">21 novembre 2023</time>)</small></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nba.com/kings/blog/kings-sign-norvel-pelle-10-day-contract\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Kings Sign Norvel Pelle to 10-Day Contract</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">nba.com</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-02-25\" data-sort-value=\"2021-02-25\">25 f\u00e9vrier 2021</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-08-21\" data-sort-value=\"2026-08-21\">21 ao\u00fbt 2026</time>)</small></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031717/https://basket-infos.com/2021/04/02/norvel-pelle-rebondit-aux-knicks/\">https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031717/https://basket-infos.com/2021/04/02/norvel-pelle-rebondit-aux-knicks/</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031722/https://basket-infos.com/2021/04/22/norvel-pelle-a-convaincu-les-knicks/\">https://archive.wikiwix.com/cache/20221003031722/https://basket-infos.com/2021/04/22/norvel-pelle-a-convaincu-les-knicks/</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20211224165639/https://basket-infos.com/2021/12/24/hardship-exceptions-les-signatures-du-jour-al-farouq-aminu-aux-celtics/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Hardship exceptions&#160;: Les signatures du jour; Al-Farouq Aminu aux Celtics</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">basket-infos.com via <a href=\"/wiki/Internet_Archive\" title=\"Internet Archive\">Internet Archive</a></span> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-03-24\" data-sort-value=\"2024-03-24\">24 mars 2024</time>)</small></span>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Liens_externes\">Liens externes</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Liens externes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Norvel_Pelle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Liens externes\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r194021218\">.mw-parser-output .autres-projets>.titre{text-align:center;margin:0.2em 0}.mw-parser-output .autres-projets>ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .autres-projets>ul>li{list-style:none;margin:0.2em 0;text-indent:0;padding-left:24px;min-height:20px;text-align:left;display:block}.mw-parser-output .autres-projets>ul>li>a{font-style:italic}@media(max-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .autres-projets{float:none}}</style><div class=\"autres-projets boite-grise boite-a-droite noprint js-interprojets\">\n<p class=\"titre\">Sur les autres projets Wikimedia&#160;:</p>\n<ul class=\"noarchive plainlinks\">\n<li class=\"commons\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Norvel_Pelle?uselang=fr\">Norvel Pelle</a>, sur <span class=\"project\">Wikimedia Commons</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"liste-horizontale\"><span class